{
    "title": "Cat Language: DIY Wallpaper",
    "description": "Cat Language: DIY Wallpaper is a unique application that allows you to customize and design your phone wallpaper in a special style with the language of cats. For those who love cats and want to bring creativity to their phones, the application helps you turn your screen into a fun and personalized space.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udd25Main features:\r\n* Available template library: Provides a series of pre-designed wallpaper templates in the style of cat language, making it easy for you to choose and customize according to your preferences.\r\n* DIY Cat Wallpaper: The app allows you to create your own wallpaper with powerful customization tools. Start by choosing an available template or be completely creative according to your own preferences.\r\n  + Cat Stickers: The app provides a collection of special cat stickers, representing the emotions and actions of cats, helping you bring a unique touch to your wallpaper.\r\n  + Alphabet toys: A fun new feature allows you to add alphabet toy letters to the wallpaper. These letters are designed in cute toy style to help you decorate your wallpaper more richly.\r\n  + Name tag: Add a name tag to your wallpaper. You can write your name, pet's name or any content you want to show on the wallpaper easily.\r\n  + Choose a background: DIY Cat Language Wallpaper provides a variety of available backgrounds from different themes such as colors, patterns or you can upload your own wallpaper for absolute personalization.\r\n  + Add stickers: A rich sticker library including bows, eyes, food, hat, house and funny patterns will help you make your wallpaper more vivid and playful.\r\n* Share and connect: Once you've finished your work, you can immediately share it with your friends, family or the global cat-loving community to enjoy and receive feedback.\r\n* My Library: Helps you store all your wallpaper designs in one place. You can easily access the wallpapers you have created and set them as wallpapers at any time without having to design from scratch. This is where you keep your favorite works and store them for different occasions.\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udf08Why will you love Cat Language: DIY Wallpaper?\r\n\u2714\ufe0fUnlimited creativity: With a diverse set of tools and a rich library, you can unleash your creativity and personalize your wallpaper in your own style.\r\n\u2714\ufe0fEasy to use: You don't need to be a design expert to create beautiful wallpapers, the application helps you do it with just a few simple steps.\r\n\u2714\ufe0fExpress your love for cats: The appl helps you express your special love for cats through every little detail such as bows, stickers, text and toy alphabets.\r\n\r\nCat Language: DIY Wallpaper brings you an inspiring creative space where you can freely create unique and personal wallpapers, while expressing your love for adorable cats.",
    "descriptionHTML": "Cat Language: DIY Wallpaper is a unique application that allows you to customize and design your phone wallpaper in a special style with the language of cats. For those who love cats and want to bring creativity to their phones, the application helps you turn your screen into a fun and personalized space.<br><br>\ud83d\udd25Main features:<br>* Available template library: Provides a series of pre-designed wallpaper templates in the style of cat language, making it easy for you to choose and customize according to your preferences.<br>* DIY Cat Wallpaper: The app allows you to create your own wallpaper with powerful customization tools. Start by choosing an available template or be completely creative according to your own preferences.<br>  + Cat Stickers: The app provides a collection of special cat stickers, representing the emotions and actions of cats, helping you bring a unique touch to your wallpaper.<br>  + Alphabet toys: A fun new feature allows you to add alphabet toy letters to the wallpaper. These letters are designed in cute toy style to help you decorate your wallpaper more richly.<br>  + Name tag: Add a name tag to your wallpaper. You can write your name, pet&#39;s name or any content you want to show on the wallpaper easily.<br>  + Choose a background: DIY Cat Language Wallpaper provides a variety of available backgrounds from different themes such as colors, patterns or you can upload your own wallpaper for absolute personalization.<br>  + Add stickers: A rich sticker library including bows, eyes, food, hat, house and funny patterns will help you make your wallpaper more vivid and playful.<br>* Share and connect: Once you&#39;ve finished your work, you can immediately share it with your friends, family or the global cat-loving community to enjoy and receive feedback.<br>* My Library: Helps you store all your wallpaper designs in one place. You can easily access the wallpapers you have created and set them as wallpapers at any time without having to design from scratch. This is where you keep your favorite works and store them for different occasions.<br><br>\ud83c\udf08Why will you love Cat Language: DIY Wallpaper?<br>\u2714\ufe0fUnlimited creativity: With a diverse set of tools and a rich library, you can unleash your creativity and personalize your wallpaper in your own style.<br>\u2714\ufe0fEasy to use: You don&#39;t need to be a design expert to create beautiful wallpapers, the application helps you do it with just a few simple steps.<br>\u2714\ufe0fExpress your love for cats: The appl helps you express your special love for cats through every little detail such as bows, stickers, text and toy alphabets.<br><br>Cat Language: DIY Wallpaper brings you an inspiring creative space where you can freely create unique and personal wallpapers, while expressing your love for adorable cats.",
